 "text": "Hey! How are you feeling? Free teddy picnic is lovely idea. Set up a little stage with blankets and a lamp, and add a box of teddy food. Move the bin as big as you can, then dig a smaller hole for the rest. A box of burgers and fries, or a big sandwich and some crackers. Keep some rustlers from the bears by facing the shade side. Play hide tag or hunt the marshmallow in the fire pit. Keep little honners like a small bag of teddy food. Fair. Add little box of dinosaur food next to the teddy food.",
